    "title": "From the less likely to the more likely",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk4-escalation-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "From the less likely to the more likely",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Make the scale clear: if the less expected case holds, the more expected case follows even more strongly. The second clause cannot be an unrelated addition.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "连最远的朋友都能来，附近的朋友更容易来。",
                "pinyin": "lián zuì yuǎn de péngyou dōu néng lái ， fùjìn de péngyou gèng róngyì lái 。",
                "meaning": "Even the friend furthest away can come; it is even easier for nearby friends to come.",
                "audio": "1b05c588daf99d302fe5fcadaf30f220847daaa5567b818e0291dd1560a4aef1"
              }
            ]
          },
